==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*þwahaną}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|thwahan}}, {{cog|goh|dwahan}}, {{cog|non|þvá}}, {{cog|got|𐌸𐍅𐌰𐌷𐌰𐌽}}. The Germanic base is also the source of {{cog|en|towel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/θwæːan/|lang=ang}}

===Verb===
{{ang-verb|head=þwēan}}

# to [[wash]], [[anoint]]

